{"seq":8,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0736"},"reason":"Proofread (reasons in the entries above / the batch report).","by":"enrich batch 053","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-enrich/enrich-report/a0724-a0916.md","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",212],["+","The film's other famous speech belongs to Vincent's partner Jules Winnfield, played by Samuel L. Jackson, who before he kills recites a passage he attributes to Ezekiel 25:17; only its last lines echo the real Bible verse. "],["=",480],["-","that"],["+","that,"],["=",1],["+","by most accounts, "],["=",56],["-","Cameron"],["+","It"],["=",1],["-","has"],["+","was"],["=",1],["-","said"],["+","improvised"],["=",1],["-","he suggested it "],["=",6],["-","because"],["+","of"],["=",1],["-","nothing"],["+","shooting,"],["=",1],["-","else felt right, "],["=",2],["-","DiCaprio thought it was silly; "],["=",391]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",210],["+","Die andere berühmte Rede des Films gehört Vincents Partner Jules Winnfield, gespielt von Samuel L. Jackson, der vor dem Töten eine Passage aufsagt, die er Hesekiel 25,17 zuschreibt; nur ihre letzten Zeilen klingen an den echten Bibelvers an. "],["=",490],["+","den meisten Berichten zufolge "],["=",48],["-","Cameron"],["+","Er"],["=",1],["-","hat"],["+","wurde"],["=",1],["-","erzählt, er habe den Satz "],["=",4],["-","vorgeschlagen,"],["+","improvisiert,"],["=",1],["-","weil nichts anderes richtig klang, "],["=",2],["-","DiCaprio fand ihn albern; "],["=",377]]}],"hash":"2bd1260ccba9"},
